       'm: Rن|Politicians use positive body language so that they appear truthful and trustworthy. This helps them to get people\'s support. // Why do politicians use positive body language?|to get support|to tell lies|to look bored',
       'w: Rم1|Walking nervously into an interview, not making eye contact and crossing your arms all send a positive message. // Is the statement True or False? => False',
