  F=[('I ______ (help) you carry that bag. (offer)','\'ll help'),('Look at the clouds! It ______ (rain).','\'s going to rain'),('We ______ (meet) Ali at 6 – it\'s arranged.','\'re meeting'),('I think Oman ______ (win) the match.','will win'),('She ______ (study) medicine next year. (plan)','is going to study')],
