        ('Terms and conditions',12,['CB p.58 Ex 2: read the Online DVD Club rules and answer a–h (age 18+, no maximum, can\'t return unless faulty, must pay within three months, 10% added after…).','Focus: must / have to / don\'t have to / should not / cannot.']),
        ('E-mail of complaint',8,['CB p.59 Ex 3: What four complaints does Helen Brown make? Is the company or the customer wrong?']),
        ('Analysing the e-mail',6,['Formal features: Dear Sir or Madam, I am writing to inform you that…, Please reply as soon as possible, Yours faithfully.']),
